{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:3.40.020","page_type":"section"},"citation":"3.40.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.40.020","content_hash":"a7f620f383583f56df993fe535f93a0585096e2628d9125c78f19b9b6d2275f4","heading":"Description of services.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.40.020:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.40.020","text":"The services which are to be provided within the district include:\n(a) The provision of landscaping, lighting, and other amenities within the Kansas Avenue right-of-way between South Fourth Street and South Tenth Avenue as part of the Kansas Avenue streetscape improvement project;\n(b) The provision of landscaping and other amenities to be made available throughout the district;\n(c) The ongoing maintenance of improvements installed within the rights-of-way within the district;\n(d) A promotional program to enhance the image of the district and to promote the economic development of the district; and\n(e) The collection of funds, accounting and financial administration for the district. (Code 1981 § 13-122. Code 1995 § 42-37.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"004c725b-48c2-5b32-8703-015fa6b3a756"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"3.40.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.40.020","content_hash":"36d2bea27ef6d08809d352832812df64241dadda860bd50acd836c35960ffd33","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.40.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.40.020:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.40.020","text":"The services which are to 